orrecting Tilak, Orion, 101. See also Fleet, Journal of the Royal Asiatic Society, 1911, 514-518; Keith, ibid., 794-800.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["bRRihaspati", "bRhaspati", "bRihaspati", "bRuhaspati", "bṛhaspati", "బృహస్పతి", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["bRRihaspati", "bRhaspati", "bRihaspati", "bRuhaspati", "bṛhaspati", "బృహస్పతి", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ"]}], "bfhaspati-gupta sayasTi": [{"id": "bfhaspati-gupta SAyasTi", "headword": "बृहस्पति-गुप्त शायस्थि", "headword_slp1": "bfhaspati-gupta SAyasTi", "fold": "bfhaspati-gupta sayasTi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vedic-index-macdonell-keith", "senses": [{"gloss": "Bṛhaspati-gupta Śāyasthi is mentioned in the vaṃśa brāhmaṇa as a pupil of bhavatrāta śāyasthi.\nFoot notes Indische Studien, 4, 372.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["bRRihaspati", "bRRihaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRRihaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRhaspati", "bRhaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRhaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRihaspati", "bRihaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRihaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRuhaspati", "bRuhaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRuhaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bṛhaspati", "bṛhaspati-gupta śāyasthi", "bṛhaspatigupta śāyasthi", "gupta shaayasthi", "gupta śāyasthi", "गुप्त शायस्थि", "बृहस्पति", "बृहस्पतिगुप्त शायस्थि", "గుప్త శాయస్థి", "బృహస్పతి", "బృహస్పతి-గుప్త శాయస్థి", "బృహస్పతిగుప్త శాయస్థి", "ಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ-ಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["bRRihaspati", "bRRihaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRRihaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRhaspati", "bRhaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRhaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRihaspati", "bRihaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRihaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bRuhaspati", "bRuhaspati-gupta shaayasthi", "bRuhaspatigupta shaayasthi", "bṛhaspati", "bṛhaspati-gupta śāyasthi", "bṛhaspatigupta śāyasthi", "gupta shaayasthi", "gupta śāyasthi", "gupta SAyasTi", "bfhaspati", "bfhaspatigupta SAyasTi", "గుప్త శాయస్థి", "బృహస్పతి", "బృహస్పతి-గుప్త శాయస్థి", "బృహస్పతిగుప్త శాయస్థి", "ಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ-ಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿಗುಪ್ತ ಶಾಯಸ್ಥಿ"]}], "bfhaspati-sava": [{"id": "bfhaspati-sava", "headword": "बृहस्पति-सव", "headword_slp1": "bfhaspati-sava", "fold": "bfhaspati-sava", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vedic-index-macdonell-keith", "senses": [{"gloss": "Bṛhaspati-sava is the name of a sacrifice by which, according to the taittirīya brāhmaṇa, the priest who desired to become a purohita obtained that office. According to the Āśvalāyana śrauta sūtra, it was the sacrifice to be performed by a priest after the vājapeya, while the king performed the rājasūya. In the Śatapatha brāhmaṇa, on the other hand, the bṛhaspatisava is identified with the vājapeya; but such identity is clearly not primitive.\nFoot notes ii. 7, 1, 2. Cf. kāṭhaka Saṃhitā, xxxvii. 7; pañcaviṃśa brāhmaṇa, xvii. 11, 4; xxv. 1, 1, 7.\nix. 9. 5.\nv. 2, 1, 19.\nEggeling, Sacred Books of the East, 41, xxiv, xxv; Weber, Indische Studien, 10, 107, 108.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["bRRihaspati", "bRRihaspati-sava", "bRRihaspatisava", "bRhaspati", "bRhaspati-sava", "bRhaspatisava", "bRihaspati", "bRihaspati-sava", "bRihaspatisava", "bRuhaspati", "bRuhaspati-sava", "bRuhaspatisava", "bṛhaspati", "bṛhaspati-sava", "bṛhaspatisava", "sava", "बृहस्पति", "बृहस्पतिसव", "सव", "బృహస్పతి", "బృహస్పతి-సవ", "బృహస్పతిసవ", "సవ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ-ಸವ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿಸವ", "ಸವ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["bRRihaspati", "bRRihaspati-sava", "bRRihaspatisava", "bRhaspati", "bRhaspati-sava", "bRhaspatisava", "bRihaspati", "bRihaspati-sava", "bRihaspatisava", "bRuhaspati", "bRuhaspati-sava", "bRuhaspatisava", "bṛhaspati", "bṛhaspati-sava", "bṛhaspatisava", "sava", "bfhaspati", "bfhaspatisava", "sava", "బృహస్పతి", "బృహస్పతి-సవ", "బృహస్పతిసవ", "సవ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿ-ಸವ", "ಬೃಹಸ್ಪತಿಸವ", "ಸವ"]}]}